<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on international indices.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on international indices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG said it has issued eight tranches of American-style mark-denominated call and put warrants each on the IBEX 35 index and the MIB 30 index.</p>
<p>Maturity date for the warrants is September 10, 1998 and the payment date is March 20, 1997. They are all listed on the Frankfurt and Duesseldorf exchanges.</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
